<title>USA: Agree Realty Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Agree Realty Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGTON HILLS, Mich. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating Results (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							Three months ended</p>
<p>								March 31</p>
<p>						     1997		1996</p>
<p> Total revenue				  $4,730	   $3,932</p>
<p> Net Income					  919		814</p>
<p> Income per share				 0.34	     0.31</p>
<p>Funds from Operations (1)</p>
<p>   Funds from Operations		     2,027	    1,661</p>
<p>   Funds from Operations -- per share     0.61	     0.51</p>
<p>Weighted average number of shares</p>
<p>  and &quot;OP&quot; Units outstanding		 3,316	    3,287</p>
<p>(1)Funds from operations are defined as income (loss) before minority interest, excluding gains (losses) from debt restructuring and sales of property, plus real estate related depreciation and amortization and after adjustments for unconsolidated partnerships and joint ventures.</p>
